//@version=6
//
// OUR CODE: a realtime limit entry that follows the close — rests a maker, requotes it (Modify,
// E-7) and cancels it every fifth bar — the dispatch-order probe (impl-08 T12, I26).
strategy("rt maker (strategy-pine T12)", overlay = true)
plot(close)
if bar_index % 5 == 4
    strategy.cancel("L")
else
    strategy.entry("L", strategy.long, limit = close - 0.5)
